  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cambodia Home-Grown School Feeding(HGSF) Project Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the educational and nutritional well-being of pre-primary and primary school children participating in the HGSFP, concurrently fostering economic opportunities within local communities; Ensuring the fulfillment of criteria for both soft and hard infrastructure, enabling the independent management of the programme and facilitating the smooth transition of schools into the NHGSFP; Sustaining the quality and effectiveness of the NHGSFP, promoting its long-term viability with adequate technical assistance and capacity strengthening efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To sustainably enhance human capital development and local economies in underserved rural communities in Cambodia through an expanded National Home Grown School Feeding Programme&#xCE84;&#xBCF4;&#xB514;&#xC544; &#xD559;&#xAD50;&#xAE09;&#xC2DD;&#xC81C;&#xB3C4;&#xC758; &#xC131;&#xACF5;&#xC801;&#xC778; &#xC774;&#xC591; &#xBC0F; &#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xC815;&#xBD80; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;&#xAC15;&#xD654;</narrative>
  </description>
